  "description": "When Woojoo follows Yoonjae, his campus crush to college, he's in for a rude awakening on the first day of classes—Yoonjae's gone off to the military! Enter Yi-hyun, a hunky softie with a heart of gold. Woojae offers Yi-hyun a job to fill all the holes...left in his heart by Yoonjae's absence. All Yi-hyun has to do is hang out with Woojae every weekend, and he'll earn big in more ways than one!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes four side story chapters.*",
